{
  "_readme": [
    "Main battles only — no route NPCs, no grunts.",
    "",
    "NOT CURRENTLY USED BY THE APP. Kept because the verified half is real work",
    "and the feature may come back. Safe to delete if you don't want it.",
    "",
    "Source: teams marked verified:true were checked against Serebii.net's",
    "Ultra Sun & Ultra Moon grand trial and Elite Four pages. Credit Serebii if",
    "you ever ship this. Entries marked verified:false were written from memory",
    "and several have already turned out to be wrong — treat them as guesses.",
    "",
    "'team' holds species slugs matching 'name' in pokemon-library.json.",
    "Alolan forms use the -alola suffix. Levels and moves are deliberately",
    "absent: the app only reads types.",
    "",
    "'role': captain, kahuna, totem, villain, rival, elite-four, boss, challenger.",
    "",
    "Nearly every entry covers both Ultra Sun and Ultra Moon. The only",
    "version-exclusives are four Totems (Verdant Cavern and Hokulani differ).",
    "",
    "Hau, Kukui and Gladion have multiple entries because their teams depend on",
    "which starter you picked."
